      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.64,
      "end_seconds": 295.31,
      "duration_seconds": 17.67,
      "text": "it's reasonable to to be concerned but right now recurrent miscarriage needing investigation is my leading thought not anything worse. Just to be sure I understood. You've had three early losses for three weeks and no clotting problem or fever"
    },
