      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.66,
      "end_seconds": 319.12,
      "duration_seconds": 18.46,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a pelvic ultrasound because of recurrent miscarriage. We should do blood tests for recurrent miscarriage. We will arrange specialist care so the next pregnancy is looked after from the the start. If the symptoms get worse that's the point to come in urgently."
